        <mxCell id="mtp-label" value="MTP: own block" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="300" y="305" width="120" height="20" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="bank-key" value="Green dashes: bank → independent MHDB reads.&lt;br&gt;Input \(p\): payload OR learned blank \(p_0\)." style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="70" y="640" width="350" height="35" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="model-note" value="One column: four [PKDA × 3, GQA] cells.&lt;br&gt;Each mixer is followed by MoE; every branch adds \(y/\sqrt{2L}\) to its residual \(h\).&lt;br&gt;MHDB reads null + seed + completed deltas + current partial (when present). Payload reads omit the partial.&lt;br&gt;\(\Delta_c=h_{\rm exit}-h_{\rm entry}\); \(h_{\rm top}=s+\sum_c\Delta_c\)." style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="70" y="685" width="350" height="100" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="recurrence-note" value="\(v\): next column, same token; all trunk weights shared.&lt;br&gt;\(f\): last column’s next-token fusion shifts right into the next pass; plain prefixes use \(p_0\).&lt;br&gt;Training: one jitter draw per column, shared by all consumers. Eval/decode: \(\xi=0\); gradients stay connected." style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="70" y="795" width="350" height="95" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="shared-note" value="Both heads share \(E\) and final RMSNorm; all entries share \(W_{\rm fuse}\). \(s_0=0.02\), \(\rho=1536/D\).&lt;br&gt;MTP has no MHDB (\(r=0\)), no loop, and no path back to the trunk; its states reset each invocation." style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="70" y="900" width="350" height="75" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="unbiased-affinity" source="TMUNOTTNDEuf5ArJhebJ-182" target="TMUNOTTNDEuf5ArJhebJ-184" edge="1" parent="1" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=9;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;entryX=1;entryY=0.5;" value="s">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" relative="1">
            <Array as="points">
              <mxPoint x="785" y="270" />
              <mxPoint x="785" y="170" />
            </Array>
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="shared-expert" value="Shared" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="475" y="355" width="65" height="20" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="selected-experts" value="\(j\in J\)" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="610" y="355" width="55" height="20" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="moe-note" value="\(s_j=\sigma((W_r x)_j),\quad J=\operatorname{TopK}(s+b)\)&lt;br&gt;\(w_j=s_j/\sum_{i\in J}s_i\)&lt;br&gt;\(y=(S(x)+k\sum_{j\in J}w_jE_j(x))/\sqrt{k+1}\)&lt;br&gt;Expert: \(W_d(\operatorname{SiLU}(g)\odot u)\).&lt;br&gt;Bias \(b\) affects selection only; updated from step counts, fixed in eval. All selected tokens execute." style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="455" y="510" width="320" height="125" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="mhdb-caption" value="MHDB reads" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="455" y="670" width="320" height="20" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="mhdb-note" value="Each read owns query \(q\), key gain \(g\), and null.&lt;br&gt;\(k_i=g\odot v_i/\sqrt{\operatorname{mean}_D(v_i^2)+\epsilon}\)&lt;br&gt;\(w_{i,h}=\operatorname{softmax}_i(q_h^\top k_{i,h})\)&lt;br&gt;\(r=\operatorname{concat}_h\sum_i w_{i,h}v_{i,h}\)&lt;br&gt;Keys normalize over full width; values stay raw.&lt;br&gt;Softmax is over sources, independently per feature group. No score scale or output projection.&lt;br&gt;Cutaway inputs: \(x=\operatorname{RMSNorm}(h+r)\)." style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="455" y="700" width="320" height="155" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="gqa-note" value="NoPE; causal prefix includes this token.&lt;br&gt;\(Q,K\): per-head RMSNorm; grouped query heads share K/V. Preset \(d_h=256\).&lt;br&gt;\(z=\operatorname{concat}_h[\operatorname{softmax}(QK^\top/\sqrt{d_h}+M_{\rm causal})V]\)&lt;br&gt;\(y=W_o(\sigma(W_gx)\odot z)\).&lt;br&gt;Gate is after attention, before output projection." style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="800" y="565" width="255" height="130" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="cache-note" value="Sequential decoding keeps one mixer-state track per column index.&lt;br&gt;GQA: all previous K/V rows.&lt;br&gt;PKDA: matrix, diagonal, and three convolution histories.&lt;br&gt;Parallel feedback passes start fresh mixer states; cached decode advances once after the last column." style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="800" y="745" width="255" height="115" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="pkda-note" value="Preset head width: \(d_k=d_v=128\). States start at zero; dashed loops delay one token.&lt;br&gt;\(\tau(z)=\exp[-\exp(a)\operatorname{softplus}(z+b)]\); \(\tau_P\) has independent parameters.&lt;br&gt;\(A_t=\alpha_P A_{t-1}+\beta_P(k_t\odot k_t)\)&lt;br&gt;Precond: \(r=\log(A_t+10^{-6})-c\), \(B=\exp[-\log(1.5)r/(1+|r|)]\).&lt;br&gt;\(k_w=B\odot k_t\); \(\bar S=\operatorname{Diag}(\alpha)S_{t-1}\); \(\varepsilon=v_t-\bar S^\top k_t\).&lt;br&gt;\(S_t=\bar S+\beta k_w\varepsilon^\top\); query reads updated \(S_t\).&lt;br&gt;¹ Packed controls + separate rank-128 decay/output-gate expansions.&lt;br&gt;\(\alpha\): key-channel vector; \(\alpha_P,\beta,\beta_P\): per-head scalars.&lt;br&gt;States accumulate in FP32; causal convolutions retain 3 previous rows." style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1090" y="825" width="480" height="170" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
</mxfile>
